# Trivy misconfiguration ignores (MegaLinter REPOSITORY_TRIVY).
#
# Reviewed false positives on the kustomize base under k8s/base. The same
# decisions are recorded as KICS suppressions in each manifest and in .checkov.yml;
# Trivy reads neither, so they are restated here. Anything not listed still gates.

# Workloads in the default namespace. This is a kustomize BASE: `metadata.namespace`
# is intentionally absent and supplied by the overlay
# (k8s/overlays/prod/kustomization.yaml: `namespace: chargate`). Setting it in the
# base would defeat the overlay pattern.
AVD-KSV-0110

# Restrict container images to trusted registries. The image is
# ghcr.io/magmamoose/chargate — our own GitHub Container Registry namespace, built
# and cosign-signed by this repo's release workflow (Diatreme image-sign). It is
# absent from Trivy's default trusted-registry list simply because that list is
# vendor-oriented, not because the source is untrusted.
AVD-KSV-0125
